        "original_id": "644dd950-643e-50ca-b428-b38f6f006253",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lillian Harmer, Carrie Nation\n- Works: A Shriek in the Night, The Bowery\n- Concepts: featured supporting roles, historical character portrayals, anti-alcohol activism\n\nFacts:\n- In 1933, Lillian Harmer was cast in featured supporting roles in the films \"A Shriek in the Night\" and \"The Bowery.\"\n- In 1933, Lillian Harmer portrayed the historical figure Carrie Nation in the film \"The Bowery.\"\n- Carrie Nation was particularly known for attacking alcohol-serving establishments, most often taverns, with a hatchet.",
